From c2516181fc1c73ea617661d77f4e0a91fdf0a490 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Gil <pando855@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:14:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] mcp-gateway: Use official standalone Helm chart

Migrate from app-template wrapper to official
agentgateway-standalone chart (oci, digest 8c3fcfb7f).

- Chart.yaml: dependency to agentgateway-standalone:1.7.0
- values.yaml: restructured for official chart
- fullnameOverride: mcp-gateway-standalone (avoids
  immutable Deployment selector conflict)
- templates/ingress.yaml: new, points to new service
- templates/configmap.yaml: deleted (chart renders it)
- templates/networkpolicy.yaml: deleted (no NP in
  foundation baseline)
- foundation-checks.py: adapted (51 tests pass)

Verified: nodeSelector prusik, routes empty, no
NetworkPolicy rendered, adminAddr off, SESSION_KEY
from existing immutable ESO secret, image v1.7.0,
TLS on nginx-external.
